      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757018+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Kestrel plans to supply Laurel next year; deliveries have not begun.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757018+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-007",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-007",
      "chunk_id": "case-007",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:e8c0a582378d2ac3176795cea3c0f19f8b06d5f05cc2b19fb02a2d12d7e4965c",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775738+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "The claim \"Maple supplies Nettle\" is false; neither company trades with the other.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775738+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-008",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-008",
      "chunk_id": "case-008",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
