      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775740+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Orchid receives goods from Poppy, which supplies Orchid.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775740+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-009",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-009",
      "chunk_id": "case-009",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:f0381852d94aab050754d5abbbf8df5e59464c45f6ff2c9a1b7a48fd56ab6a5b",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775752+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Quince met Rowan at a conference. Saffron supplies Thistle.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775752+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-013",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-013",
      "chunk_id": "case-013",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:710366111016be478a0098cad4c6c57a1795a59f55ba313651b4d94d942c188a",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646948+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Amber owns Birch.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646948+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-014",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-014",
      "chunk_id": "case-014",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:c6b78f82f5b2bebef20edfd9b4db1fd365b45ab8442abe3995a520a158553b40",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646956+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Cedar is owned by Dune.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646956+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-015",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-015",
      "chunk_id": "case-015",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:1e204a78e61cc438179323a91826364e815dbb9831dd7f0947c6669237f0a69e",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646965+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Ember is a subsidiary of Fern.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646965+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-016",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-016",
      "chunk_id": "case-016",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:683c8a0296e75b270ea1b353dd8d6db4e52bdb5f9d924c172b2fa2f096364d94",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757019+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Glade does not own Harbor.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757019+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-017",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-017",
      "chunk_id": "case-017",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:6f9e871cec918fd9329974557a4f833b9dc3fa60c2338a34c04823b5f8094db3",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757021+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Indigo may acquire Jade, but no agreement exists.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757021+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-018",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-018",
      "chunk_id": "case-018",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:9cf14e6c1a6a65800047ca2a8d5b6d8e41e984054e8b023b387fe991bc542224",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757022+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Kelvin plans to acquire Lotus next year; Lotus remains independent.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757022+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-019",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-019",
      "chunk_id": "case-019",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:128d57830de4c5ca509cfcf03bbb72d5825b3bade7b754e8f51a611cfe62bedd",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775754+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "The statement \"Meadow owns Nimbus\" was retracted as false.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775754+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-020",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-020",
      "chunk_id": "case-020",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:f157a313327357a74ce3710968b3b301d4f346ba75c589dfb67c8d84f131542d",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775756+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Onyx is a subsidiary of Pearl, so Pearl owns Onyx.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775756+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-021",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-021",
      "chunk_id": "case-021",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:61cf3abad95b5f10e11e62a5416bda7eba330f6ae877b1119d2494a56bce16b8",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775765+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Quartz advises Reed. Spruce owns Tundra.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775765+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-025",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-025",
      "chunk_id": "case-025",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:2531226ce749f0908faa1182edfdd0a8e0058e8af96f366669b3407faddf967a",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646973+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Atlas depends on Beacon.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646973+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-026",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-026",
      "chunk_id": "case-026",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:1ba2d2f82beda23845c78b14ccc80635f55bd01c5e9ad402295b5a2687604295",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646979+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Cipher is required by Delta.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646979+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-027",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-027",
      "chunk_id": "case-027",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:9c2025bf70be2cb8ad7280723a519fd1b8919e63c4354dde1b15f1b9268f2947",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646987+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Echo requires Flux to run.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646987+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-028",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-028",
      "chunk_id": "case-028",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:b72ebcb1ea147f2d352c686ffb476ebaff3bcc6d186eb09f3cb882f86934ef49",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757023+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Grid does not depend on Halo.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757023+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-029",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-029",
      "chunk_id": "case-029",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:10648025a89b0d1261a2c83ce06b2fd34342991256cc86cdce25f0f24e94ce49",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757025+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Ion might depend on Jolt after a future redesign.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757025+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-030",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-030",
      "chunk_id": "case-030",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:605fbb729054e30f9e990a6064cba6436e934d1d916a05eb9da855d5f0445aee",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757026+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Kernel plans to require Lumen in the next release; the current release works without it.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:01.757026+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-031",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-031",
      "chunk_id": "case-031",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:2770e27d3006bdfb4bf375e7b007bef6ef5b1ed6baf32aa139463c6a2b13f272",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775767+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "The documentation claim \"Mesh depends on Nova\" is incorrect; Mesh works without Nova.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775767+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-032",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-032",
      "chunk_id": "case-032",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:ecf757e6295d2dcea710c59553ab276b4f00aa8c3e3d7365843e6930a131f244",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775768+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Orbit is required by Pulse, which depends on Orbit.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775768+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-033",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-033",
      "chunk_id": "case-033",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:3f4367d97a60147bac049a6f1456b2e32aaecdc6f8a6ec09427e5019d88e958e",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775776+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Queue and Relay share a maintainer. Stack depends on Trace.",
      "title": "Fictional relation extraction note",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:04.775776+00:00"
    },
    {
      "_id": "chunks/baseline-luna-1-case-037",
      "_key": "baseline-luna-1-case-037",
      "chunk_id": "case-037",
      "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:112eece7ae363072fda7bdf80c40ba249a6b9b956090ff0ae1ef577a7a6abb9d",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T11:29:00.646999+00:00",
      "space_id": "baseline-luna-1",
      "text": "Alder is headquartered in Bellport.",
